payload.description:
Replace the hard-coded legacy hosted-zone assumption with explicit deployment configuration. The target production stack must create only the site bucket, CloudFront distribution, certificate request, exports, and pipeline prerequisites until DNS is intentionally enabled.

Tests:
- synthesis with DNS disabled contains no Route 53 record resources;
- synthesis rejects DNS-enabled deployment without an explicit hosted-zone configuration;
- pipeline imports only the target site stack exports and remains restricted to its bucket and distribution.

Do not deploy or change DNS in this task.
